  DIFF q m2-n-cl2.dupOf: fixture undefined | PK "m2-n-cl1"
  DIFF q m2-n-cl2.teach: fixture undefined | PK [{"h":"The idea","list":["With the weight in pounds, a clearance question has three steps before the final product.","First, convert the weight to kilograms by dividing by 2.2.","Second, turn the percent-of-body-weight volume into an absolute volume in litres, taking 1 kg as 1 L.","Third, convert the half-life into a rate constant: k = {{frac:0.693|t½}}.","Only then does Cl = k·VD apply. Skipping any one step changes the answer by a whole factor, not by a rounding."]}]
