  DIFF q m4-n-clt.steps.0.why: fixture "Total body clearance is the overall elimination rate constant multiplied by the volume of distribution, the relationship the professor requires from memory alongside the half-life equation. Both quantities are available here, one from the stated half-life and one stated directly." | PK "Total body clearance is the overall elimination rate constant multiplied by the volume of distribution, the relationship Dr. Mosley requires from memory alongside the half-life equation. Both quantities are available here, one from the stated half-life and one stated directly."
