  DIFF q m4-n-clt.source: fixture undefined | PK "both"
  DIFF q m4-n-clt.teach: fixture undefined | PK [{"h":"The idea","list":["Total body clearance (ClT) can be built from either of two pairs: k and VD (apparent volume of distribution), as here, or the dose and the AUC (area under the curve).","ClT = k x VD, because the amount leaving per hour is k times the amount in the body, VD x Cp; dividing that rate by Cp leaves k x VD.","ClT does not say which organ did the clearing; splitting it into organ contributions is the next step, and it needs fe, the fraction excreted unchanged.","Her slide \"Clearance, Elimination Half-Life, and Volume of Distribution\" carries ClT = k x VD."]}]
