  DIFF q m4-n-crcl.teach: fixture undefined | PK [{"h":"The order of steps","list":["Convert the height to inches, then compute the ideal body weight (IBW) from sex and height.","Substitute age, IBW and SCr (serum creatinine) into CrCl = {{frac:(140 - age)(IBW)|72 x SCr}}, and apply the 0.85 factor only if the patient is female.","A higher IBW raises the estimate; a higher age or a higher SCr lowers it.","The result is compared with 120 to 130 mL/min, and 58 mL/min is well below that."]}]
